invariant: INV-55
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: an empty record of application data ends a run of KeyUpdates, so
  a peer that sends one after each KeyUpdate sends KeyUpdates with no
  limit and gives the caller no data. bin/unit sends a full run, an empty
  data record and one KeyUpdate more, and requires CH_KEY_UPDATE_LIMIT.

--- old
        if (pt_len > 0) {
            t->key_update_run = 0;
        }
--- new
        t->key_update_run = 0;
